Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.37-rt55 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.37 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: cfe436c0582a290b6319510477a2fbfd7ec96b24


Or to build 3.2.37-rt55 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.37.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.37-rt55.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve
